type View='home'|'report'|'receipt'|'status'|'dashboard'|'incidents'|'map'|'routes'|'teams'|'contractors'|'analytics'|'review'|'settings'|'help'|'crew';
const pathFor=(v:View)=>({home:'/',report:'/report',receipt:'/report/receipt',status:'/report/status',help:'/help',dashboard:'/council/overview',incidents:'/council/incidents',map:'/council/map',routes:'/council/routes',teams:'/council/teams',contractors:'/council/partners',analytics:'/council/analytics',review:'/council/review',settings:'/council/settings',crew:'/contractor/jobs'}[v]);
function fromPath():View{const p=window.location.pathname;if(p==='/map'||p==='/partner/map')return 'map';if(p==='/partner/login'||p==='/partner/dashboard')return 'dashboard';if(p.startsWith('/report/status'))return 'status';const aliases:Record<string,View>={'/partner/incidents':'incidents','/partner/routes':'routes','/partner/teams':'teams','/partner/contractors':'contractors','/partner/analytics':'analytics','/admin/review':'review','/partner/settings':'settings','/partner/crew':'crew'};return aliases[p]||(Object.keys({home:1,report:1,receipt:1,dashboard:1,incidents:1,map:1,routes:1,teams:1,contractors:1,analytics:1,review:1,settings:1,help:1,crew:1}) as View[]).find(v=>pathFor(v)===p)||'home'}
const makeId=()=>{const b=crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint8Array(16));b[6]=(b[6]&15)|64;b[8]=(b[8]&63)|128;return Array.from(b,x=>x.toString(16).padStart(2,'0')).join('').replace(/^(.{8})(.{4})(.{4})(.{4})(.{12})$/,'$1-$2-$3-$4-$5')};
const fmt=(s:string)=>new Date(s).toLocaleDateString('en-GB',{day:'numeric',month:'short'});
const time=(s:string)=>new Date(s).toLocaleString('en-GB',{day:'numeric',month:'short',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'});
function Logo({small=false}:{small?:boolean}){return <span className={`logo ${small?'small':''}`}><svg width="32" height="35" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M31 53C7 45 7 23 11 13c16 0 26 13 20 40Z" fill="#a9cbb0"/><path d="M33 53c-4-24 5-34 22-40 3 21-4 34-22 40Z" fill="#4f8c67"/><path d="m17 24 15 31 13-30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="2"/></svg><span>WasteOps</span></span>}
function Badge({status}:{status:string}){return <span className={`badge ${status.toLowerCase().replaceAll(' ','-')}`}><span/>{status}</span>}
function PriorityBadge({priority}:{priority:Priority}){return <span className={`priority-badge priority-${priority.toLowerCase()}`}><span/>{priority}</span>}
function incidentPriority(i:Incident):Priority{return i.priority||priorityFor(i.category,i.hazardConcern)}
function categoryLabel(category:string,language:ReportLanguage){const labels:Record<string,Record<ReportLanguage,string>>={Litter:{en:'Litter',ur:'کچرا',ar:'قمامة'},'Fly-tipping':{en:'Fly-tipping / dumped waste',ur:'غیر قانونی طور پر پھینکا گیا کچرا',ar:'نفايات ملقاة بشكل غير قانوني'},'Overflowing bin':{en:'Overflowing bin',ur:'بھرا ہوا کوڑا دان',ar:'حاوية ممتلئة'},'Street cleaning':{en:'Street cleaning',ur:'سڑک کی صفائی',ar:'تنظيف الشوارع'},'Hazardous material':{en:'Hazardous material',ur:'خطرناک مواد',ar:'مواد خطرة'},Other:{en:'Other',ur:'دیگر',ar:'أخرى'}};return labels[category]?.[language]||category}
type TrackedReport={reference:string;stage:string;timeline:{label:string;at:string}[]};
function fromTracking(result:TrackedReport):Incident{return {id:result.reference,reference:result.reference,category:'',status:result.stage,address:'',lat:0,lng:0,note:'',photo:'',crew:'',createdAt:result.timeline[0]?.at||new Date().toISOString(),events:result.timeline.map(e=>({text:e.label,at:e.at})),demo:false}}
function progressLabel(status:string){const labels:Record<string,string>={Reported:'Report received by WasteOps','Under review':'Information review',Assigned:'Cleaning unit assigned','In progress':'Cleaning in progress',Resolved:'Verified complete',Reopened:'Further review needed',Authorised:'Work approved',Travelling:'Cleaning unit dispatched',Arrived:'Cleaning unit arrived',Working:'Cleaning in progress',Completed:'Cleaning finished','Evidence submitted':'Completion photo added · awaiting review',Accepted:'Verified complete',Disputed:'Further review needed'};return labels[status]||status}
function safeEventLabel(text:string){const value=text.toLowerCase();if(value.includes('report received')||value.includes('report submitted'))return 'Report received by WasteOps';if(value.includes('information reviewed')||value.includes('category reviewed')||value.includes('under review'))return 'Information review';if(value.includes('work authorised'))return 'Work approved';if(value.includes('assigned to'))return 'Cleaning unit assigned';if(value.includes('dispatched')||value.includes('travelling'))return 'Cleaning unit dispatched';if(value.includes('arrived'))return 'Cleaning unit arrived';if(value.includes('cleaning started')||value.includes('job working'))return 'Cleaning in progress';if(value.includes('cleaning finished')||value.includes('job completed'))return 'Cleaning finished';if(value.includes('after-cleaning photo added'))return 'Completion photo added';if(value.includes('photo reviewed')||value.includes('accepted'))return 'Completion checked';if(value.includes('disputed')||value.includes('follow-up required'))return 'Further review needed';if(value.includes('still there'))return 'Issue reported as still present';if(value.includes('linked as a duplicate')||value.includes('merge'))return 'Linked to a related report';return 'Report updated'}
function SmallPhoto({i,className=''}:{i:Incident;className?:string}){return <div className={`incident-photo ${i.category.toLowerCase().replaceAll(' ','-')} ${className}`}><img src={i.photo} alt={`${i.category} at ${i.address}`} style={{objectPosition:i.category==='Litter'?'20% 75%':i.category==='Overflowing bin'?'80% 70%':'90% 70%'}} onError={e=>{e.currentTarget.style.opacity='0'}}/><Camera size={22} className="photo-fallback"/></div>}
function Spark({values}:{values:number[]}){const max=Math.max(...values,1);return <svg className="spark" width="90" height="28" viewBox="0 0 90 28" aria-label="Incident counts over the last seven days"><polyline points={values.map((v,j)=>`${j*14.5+1},${25-v/max*21}`).join(' ')} fill="none" stroke="#6a9170" strokeWidth="1.5"/></svg>}

