 {view==='help'&&<main className="help-page" id="main"><span className="eyebrow">HERE TO HELP</span><h1>A clearer way to report<br/>and coordinate.</h1><p className="lede">WasteOps brings street reports and operational work into one place. This is a private working preview.</p>{[{q:'How do I report an issue?',a:'Take or upload a photo, confirm the map location, add an optional note and submit. A category or email is not required. This preview uses your existing private site access; a public reporting pilot would allow anonymous submissions.'},{q:'Has my report been sent to the council?',a:'No. Reports in this version are stored in your WasteOps preview. There is no council integration, service guarantee or automatic dispatch.'},{q:'What happens to my photo and location?',a:'Uploaded report photos and locations are stored privately for your signed-in account. Photo processing removes camera metadata before upload. Do not include sensitive details. Public image publication, redaction and a formal retention policy must be agreed before a public pilot.'},{q:'Are the local incidents real?',a:'The example incidents are illustrative and marked Demo. Reports you submit are saved records in the private preview. You can hide the examples in Settings.'},{q:'Can the platform assign crews automatically?',a:'A supervisor selects a suitable crew and approves route changes. Nearby suggestions consider crew capability; the preview does not calculate road travel times or automatically commission work.'},{q:'What if something is dangerous?',a:'Keep a safe distance from hazardous waste. This prototype does not provide emergency response or specialist dispatch. Use the appropriate official reporting channel for urgent issues.'}].map(x=><details key={x.q}><summary>{x.q}<Plus size={18}/></summary><p>{x.a}</p></details>)}<button className="btn primary" onClick={resetReport}>Report an issue <ArrowRight size={16}/></button></main>}
